{"type":"message","id":"539eda62","parentId":"d6d9ad09","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:35:24.411Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 4:35 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 16:35 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778862924322}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc6ccfd1","parentId":"539eda62","timestamp":"2026-05-15T16:35:35.237Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for discussions and respond to any new messages. Let me first fetch the history from both threads to see what's happening.\n\nI need to make GET requests to:\n1. https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\n\nWith header: API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n\nLet me fetch both simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-17f56e9b-6e91-41ec-ae8c-93bbaf43b7c4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6a0e6f29-59a2-4365-8adf-e422bd427f48","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10867,"output":240,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11363,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778862924411,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c0660d85-8b65-4834-b362-08346cc9fdb9"}}
